ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Li does his math homework in his room. His mom tells him to go to his aunt's house tonight. Xiao Li is busy doing his homework, only thinking about finishing it quickly, and casually agrees. At dinner, his dad asks, \"Are we going to your aunt's house tonight?\" Xiao Li says, \"No, we don't have plans.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Li say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Li is busy thinking about eating and does not hear his mother's plan for tonight.\nB. Xiao Li deliberately lies because he does not want to go to his aunt's house.\nC. Xiao Li deliberately lies because he wants to continue doing homework.\nD. Xiao Li forgets the plan his mother tells him because he focuses on his math homework.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266667871076105,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3c6d6006945d28060ed","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368454796,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0d4fbe0971434a598eb1a2ee39915f85"}